  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">People to people reconciliation program in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The People-to-People program brings different ethnicities, religions, and political allegiances together to trusted, safe spaces for dialogue. Through this dialogue and connection, division and prejudice can be reduced, mutual understanding and tolerance created, and positive relationships built.</narrative>
  </description>
